# Environment of the recognition service only (compose.prod.yaml, second env_file; missing is fine).
# Copy to .env.recognition in the repository root, mode 0600: it is git-ignored (.env.*) and never
# enters an image. The value is the long-lived subscription token printed by `claude setup-token`
# on your own machine; web, celery and `ck manage` containers do not read this file.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
